{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"sandbox_step","step":"file_written","status":"running","path":"/home/user/app/contracts/test/ShiftProof.t.sol","toolCallId":"01a17b2c-bf5d-71de-9db5-7ab364a7f763"}}
{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"file_write_streaming","toolCallId":"01a17b2c-bf5d-71de-9db5-7ab364a7f763","path":"/home/user/app/contracts/test/ShiftProof.t.sol","status":"running","chunk":"    // Rate at exact MAX_HOURLY_RATE boundary (1000 USDC/h, 1h → escrow 1000 USDC <= 10000)\n    function test_create_max_rate_boundary() public {\n        // Read the constant BEFORE the prank so the external call does not consume it.\n        uint256 maxRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE();\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        uint256 id = sp.createShift(worker, maxRate, DUR);\n        assertEq(sp.getShift(id).escrow, 1_000e6);\n    }\n\n    // Rate above MAX_HOURLY_RATE reverts InvalidAmount regardless of duration\n    function test_create_rate_above_max_reverts() public {\n        // Read the constant and set up expectRevert BEFORE the prank so neither\n        // external call consumes the prank before createShift runs.\n        uint256 overRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE() + 1;\n        vm.expectRevert(ShiftProof.InvalidAmount.selector);\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        sp.createShift(worker, overRate, DUR);\n    }","oldContent":"    // Rate at exact MAX_HOURLY_RATE boundary (1000 USDC/h, 1h → escrow 1000 USDC <= 10000)\n    function test_create_max_rate_boundary() public {\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        uint256 id = sp.createShift(worker, sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE(), DUR);\n        assertEq(sp.getShift(id).escrow, 1_000e6);\n    }\n\n    // Rate above MAX_HOURLY_RATE reverts InvalidAmount regardless of duration\n    function test_create_rate_above_max_reverts() public {\n        uint256 overRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE() + 1;\n        // The rate guard fires before any token movement, so no balance needed\n        vm.prank(employer);\n        vm.expectRevert(ShiftProof.InvalidAmount.selector);\n        sp.createShift(worker, overRate, DUR);\n    }","totalLines":18,"oldTotalLines":15}}
{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a17b2c-bf5d-71de-9db5-7ab364a7f763","toolName":"edit_file","args":{"file_path":"/home/user/app/contracts/test/ShiftProof.t.sol","old_string":"[redacted]","new_string":"[redacted]"},"result":"Successfully replaced 1 occurrence(s) in '/home/user/app/contracts/test/ShiftProof.t.sol'\n\nResulting context around the edit:\n181\t        new ShiftProof(address(m18));\n182\t    }\n183\t\n184\t    // Rate at exact MAX_HOURLY_RATE boundary (1000 USDC/h, 1h → escrow 1000 USDC <= 10000)\n185\t    function test_create_max_rate_boundary() public {\n186\t        // Read the constant BEFORE the prank so the external call does not consume it.\n187\t        uint256 maxRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE();\n188\t        vm.prank(employer);\n189\t        uint256 id = sp.createShift(worker, maxRate, DUR);\n190\t        assertEq(sp.getShift(id).escrow, 1_000e6);\n191\t    }\n192\t\n193\t    // Rate above MAX_HOURLY_RATE reverts InvalidAmount regardless of duration\n194\t    function test_create_rate_above_max_reverts() public {\n195\t        // Read the constant and set up expectRevert BEFORE the prank so neither\n196\t        // external call consumes the prank before createShift runs.\n197\t        uint256 overRate = sp.MAX_HOURLY_RATE() + 1;\n198\t        vm.expectRevert(ShiftProof.InvalidAmount.selector);\n199\t        vm.prank(employer);\n200\t        sp.createShift(worker, overRate, DUR);\n201\t    }\n202\t}\n203\t\n204\t// ============================================================================="}}
