{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a17b31-3c26-777d-a780-31c428db124d","toolName":"read_file","args":{"file_path":"/home/user/app/AGENTS.md","limit":200},"result":"{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain_core\",\"messages\",\"ToolMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"status\":\"success\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"     1\\t# [App Name]\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t> Built with Arc Studio - money-powered apps in minutes\\n     4\\t\\n     5\\tThis is the **project memory** - what Arc Studio remembers about building this app. It helps future agents (or humans) understand and extend the project.\\n     6\\t\\n     7\\t---\\n     8\\t\\n     9\\t## What This App Does\\n    10\\t\\n    11\\t[Brief description of what the app does and its primary use case]\\n    12\\t\\n    13\\t## Tech Stack\\n    14\\t\\n    15\\t- Frontend: React 18, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS\\n    16\\t- Web3: wagmi v2, viem v2, ConnectKit\\n    17\\t- Contracts: Solidity 0.8.28 + Foundry. Sources in `contracts/`, unit tests in `contracts/test/*.t.sol`. Build with `bun run contracts:build` (`forge build`), test with `bun run contracts:test` (`forge test`).\\n    18\\t- Wallet: injected (MetaMask, etc.)\\n    19\\t- Chain: Arc Testnet (Chain ID: 5042002, imported from `viem/chains`)\\n    20\\t- Token: USDC (6 decimals) (Address: 0x3600000000000000000000000000000000000000, Chain: Arc Testnet)\\n    21\\t- Toasts: Sonner\\n    22\\t\\n    23\\t## Key Files\\n    24\\t\\n    25\\t- `src/App.tsx` - Main application logic\\n    26\\t- `src/components/` - UI components\\n    27\\t- `src/config.ts` - wagmi config (chains, connectors, transports)\\n    28\\t\\n    29\\t## To Run\\n    30\\t\\n    31\\t```bash\\n    32\\tbun install\\n    33\\tbun run dev\\n    34\\t```\"}],\"tool_call_id\":\"toolu_bdrk_01SuHxYqdSWuCm6LY1R3VWbe\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"metadata\":{\"versions\":{\"@langchain/core\":\"1.2.18\"}},\"additional_kwargs\":{},\"response_metadata\":{}}}"}}
